sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor M as Maker
  participant C1 as C1 Deploy (parent)
  participant SP as ALM-Admin SharePoint
  participant DEV as DEV Dataverse
  participant C2 as C2 Import (child)
  participant C3 as C3 Post-import (child)
  participant TEST as TEST Dataverse

  M->>C1: Run (Solution=Demo, Target=TEST)
  C1->>SP: Get ALMConfig row, ALMConnections, ALMVariables
  C1->>DEV: FetchXML: conn refs + env vars in solution
  alt mapping row missing
    C1->>SP: Write log (Prechecks Failed)
    C1-->>M: Failed: Missing mapping rows
  end
  C1->>DEV: ExportSolutionAsync (managed) + poll job
  C1->>DEV: DownloadSolutionExportData
  C1->>SP: Create Solutions/Demo/Demo_managed_time.zip
  opt RunImport = Yes
    C1->>C2: Run child: text=ZIP path, text_1=Demo, text_2=TEST (no retry)
    C2->>SP: Read config + mappings, read ZIP
    C2->>DEV: FetchXML conn refs (filter mapping rows)
    C2->>TEST: ImportSolutionAsync + ComponentParameters, poll job
    alt import ok
      C2-->>C1: Reply status=Succeeded, message, importjobkey
    else any failure
      C2-->>C1: Reply status=Failed, message=reason
      Note over C2: then Terminate Failed (run history)
    end
  end
  opt RunPostImport = Yes
    C1->>C3: Run child: text=Demo, text_1=TEST (no retry)
    C3->>TEST: Check conn ref bindings = ALMConnections
    C3->>TEST: Update env variable values from ALMVariables
    C3->>TEST: Turn on solution flows that are off
    C3-->>C1: Reply status + message
  end
  C1->>SP: Write DeploymentLogs/Demo_TEST_time.json
  C1-->>M: Succeeded, or Failed with first failure message
